<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h2>Account existence check <span class="tag">Blind SQLi</span></h2>

<form method="get" action="/account/check">
  <input name="name" value="<%= name %>" />
  <button>Check</button>
</form>

<p>Query run:</p>
<pre><code><%= sql %></code></pre>
<p class="result"><b><%= message %></b></p>

<div class="hint">
  <h4>Boolean-blind exploit</h4>
  <p>The response text differs depending on whether the WHERE clause matched a
     row. Use that oracle to leak the admin password one character at a time:</p>
  <pre><code>/account/check?name=admin' AND substr(password,1,1)='a' --</code></pre>
  <p>"Account exists." means the guessed character was right. Script the scan
     over positions 1..N and the alphabet.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
